{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Patch Hero, every step you take is one you create. Place tiles to shape the battlefield, carve paths through dangerous terrain, and uncover hidden rewards. But beware\u2014enemies move when you do, and each patch you place could bring you closer to victory\u2026 or to defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The runs are short, the rules are light, and the fun comes from slowly piecing things together and seeing how far you can make it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build the world as you play</strong> \u2013 place tiles to connect paths, explore new spaces, and open up opportunities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical turn-based combat</strong> \u2013 enemies move when you do, so plan carefully.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike replayability</strong> \u2013 each run is unique, with new layouts, enemies, and treasures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover loot &amp; upgrades</strong> \u2013 treasure chests and special tiles hold powerful items to help you survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless combinations</strong> \u2013 patch together the battlefield in countless ways.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3949220?t=1768494775","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3949220?t=1768494775","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949220/74c39b5725137f748945a171b41c8d54f16d58ad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768494775","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949220/74c39b5725137f748945a171b41c8d54f16d58ad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768494775","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Patch Hero, every step you take is one you create. Place tiles to shape the battlefield, carve paths through dangerous terrain, and uncover hidden rewards. But beware\u2014enemies move when you do, and each patch you place could bring you closer to victory\u2026 or to defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The runs are short, the rules are light, and the fun comes from slowly piecing things together and seeing how far you can make it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build the world as you play</strong> \u2013 place tiles to connect paths, explore new spaces, and open up opportunities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical turn-based combat</strong> \u2013 enemies move when you do, so plan carefully.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike replayability</strong> \u2013 each run is unique, with new layouts, enemies, and treasures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover loot &amp; upgrades</strong> \u2013 treasure chests and special tiles hold powerful items to help you survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless combinations</strong> \u2013 patch together the battlefield in countless ways.</p></li></ul>","developers":["VaragtP"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949220/e